.\" Exact option forms from setterm, systemd-repart, git, lsfd, lastlog2, and ukify
.TH FORMS 1
.SH NAME
forms \- generated option spelling regressions
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fB--bold\fR on|off
.RS 4
Turn bold mode on or off.
.RE
.PP
\fB--background\fR \fI8-color\fR|default
.RS 4
Set the background color.
.RE
.PP
\fB--blank\fR[=0-60|force|poke]
.RS 4
Set blanking behavior.
.RE
.PP
\fB--split=\fR [BOOL]
.RS 4
Enable split artifacts.
.RE
.PP
\-\-
.RS 4
Do not interpret further arguments as options.
.RE
.PP
\fB\fR\fB-r\fR, \fB--remove\fR
.RS 4
Remove a module.
.RE
.PP
\fB-i\fR[4|6], \fB--inet\fR[=4|=6]
.RS 4
List IPv4 or IPv6 sockets.
.RE
.PP
\fB--raw\fR[=payload|packet]
.RS 4
Dump binary answer records.
.RE
.PP
\fB-d\fR, *--database \fIFILE\fR
.RS 4
Select the database file.
.RE
.PP
\fILinux=\fR\fILINUX\fR, \fB--linux=\fR\fILINUX\fR
.RS 4
Path to the kernel binary.
.RE
.PP
\fILinux=\fR\fILINUX\fR
.RS 4
Pure configuration entry, not a CLI option.
.RE
.SH CORE OS COMMAND LINE ARGUMENTS
.PP
\fI-b\fR, \fIrd.emergency\fR, \fIemergency\fR
.RS 4
Boot compatibility aliases.
.RE
.SH KEYS
.PP
\fI+\fR, \fI-\fR
.RS 4
Interactive keys, not CLI flags.
.RE
.SH ARGUMENTS
.PP
\fI-1\fR
.RS 4
A process selector, not an option.
.RE
.SH CONSTANTS
.PP
\fB-E2BIG\fR
.RS 4
Error constant.
.RE
.SH Special Slice Units
.PP
-.slice
.RS 4
Unit name, not a flag.
.RE
